# {{.Name}} (List Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Each result is an object that the [`{{.Name}}`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/workplace-as-code/msteams/latest/docs/resources/{{ index (split .Name (printf "%s_" .ProviderShortName)) 1 }}) resource can import. `terraform query -generate-config-out=generated.tf` writes the resource and `import` blocks of every result: see [Import an existing tenant](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/workplace-as-code/msteams/latest/docs/guides/import_existing).

## Example Usage

```terraform
list "{{.Name}}" "all" {
  provider = {{.ProviderShortName}}
}
```
